  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1901.25 Rebuilt vehicle",
  "priorExpiration": "2022-09-27",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1901.25 \"Rebuilt vehicle\" means a vehicle that was once declared a salvage vehicle and has been restored so that it is in condition for legal use on a public way.\n\nSource. #8339, eff 4-26-05 (from Saf-C 1902.20); ss by #10190, eff 9-27-12, EXPIRED: 9-27-22 (from Saf-C 1901.26)\n\nNew. #13614, eff 4-25-23 (formerly Saf-C 1901.23)",
